Package: sRtr
Title: Work with Scientific Registry of Transplant Recipients Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Vagish", family = "Hemmige",
           email = "vagish.hemmige@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-6346-1826")),
    person(given = "Jonathan", family = "Czeresnia",
           email = "j.cz@rutgers.edu",
           role = "aut"))
Description: Load, label and prepare the Scientific Registry of
    Transplant Recipients (SRTR) Standard Analysis Files (SAFs) for
    reproducible research. Applies variable labels and factor levels from
    the SRTR data dictionary, standardizes missing values, and derives
    analysis variables such as the Pancreas Donor Risk Index (PDRI),
    composite death and time-to-event outcomes. Downloads public Health
    Resources and Services Administration (HRSA) maps of transplant
    centers, organ procurement organization service areas and Organ
    Procurement and Transplantation Network (OPTN) regions, and calculates
    how much of a population or case count falls within transplant center
    catchment areas. The SAFs
    themselves are not included; users obtain them from SRTR under their
    own data use agreement.
